<title>FINLAND: ICE HOCKEY-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>ICE HOCKEY-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>TURKU, Finland 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ice hockey world</p>
<p>championship standings after Monday's games:</p>
<p>    Pool A		 P   W   D   L   F   A  Pts</p>
<p> 1. Czech Republic     2   2   0   0   4   2   4</p>
<p> 2. Russia		 2   1   1   0   7   3   3</p>
<p> 4. Slovakia	     2   1   1   0   7   5   3</p>
<p> 3. Finland		2   1   0   1   7   3   2</p>
<p> 5. France		 2   0   0   2   4  11   0</p>
<p> 6. Germany		2   0   0   2   2   7   0</p>
<p>Pool B</p>
<p> 1. Sweden		 2   2   0   0  12   5   4</p>
<p> 2. U.S.		   2   2   0   0   8   5   4</p>
<p> 3. Canada		 2   1   0   1   9   7   2</p>
<p> 4. Italy		  2   1   0   1   8   9   2</p>
<p> 5. Latvia		 2   0   0   2   8  10   0</p>
<p> 6. Norway		 2   0   0   2   1  10   0</p>
<p>Note: Top three teams qualify for medal round</p>
</text>
